('kim-mex-construction-investment-coltd-cache-service_show_data_construction_en','a:5:{s:2:\"id\";s:12:\"construction\";s:5:\"title\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:12:\"Construction\";s:2:\"kh\";s:27:\"ការសាងសង់\";}s:4:\"desc\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:141:\"World-class building and civil engineering solutions. We deliver robust structures tailored to residential, commercial, and industrial needs.\";s:2:\"kh\";s:397:\"ដំណោះស្រាយវិស្វកម្មស៊ីវិល និងសំណង់កម្រិតពិភពលោក។ យើងផ្តល់ជូននូវរចនាសម្ព័ន្ធរឹងមាំតម្រូវតាមតម្រូវការលំនៅដ្ឋាន ពាណិជ្ជកម្ម និងឧស្សាហកម្ម។\";}s:5:\"image\";s:38:\"/images/webp/projects/Thumbnail-1.webp\";s:10:\"scopeItems\";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:17:\"Civil Engineering\";s:2:\"kh\";s:17:\"Civil Engineering\";}i:1;a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:18:\"Building Structure\";s:2:\"kh\";s:18:\"Building Structure\";}i:2;a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:11:\"MEP Systems\";s:2:\"kh\";s:11:\"MEP Systems\";}i:3;a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:17:\"Industrial Plants\";s:2:\"kh\";s:17:\"Industrial Plants\";}}}',1780514774),
('kim-mex-construction-investment-coltd-cache-services_index_data','a:4:{i:0;a:5:{s:2:\"id\";s:12:\"design-build\";s:5:\"title\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:14:\"Design & Build\";s:2:\"kh\";s:40:\"រចនា និងសាងសង់\";}s:4:\"desc\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:136:\"A seamless integration of architectural creativity and engineering precision. We handle the entire lifecycle from concept to completion.\";s:2:\"kh\";s:359:\"ការរួមបញ្ចូលគ្នារវាងភាពច្នៃប្រឌិតស្ថាបត្យកម្ម និងភាពជាក់លាក់នៃវិស្វកម្ម។ យើងគ្រប់គ្រងវដ្តជីវិតទាំងមូលពីគំនិតដល់ការបញ្ចប់។\";}s:5:\"image\";s:38:\"/images/webp/projects/Thumbnail-1.webp\";s:8:\"features\";a:4:{i:0;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Architectural Design\";}i:1;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:22:\"Structural Engineering\";}i:2;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Permit Acquisition\";}i:3;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Turnkey Construction\";}}}i:1;a:5:{s:2:\"id\";s:12:\"construction\";s:5:\"title\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:12:\"Construction\";s:2:\"kh\";s:27:\"ការសាងសង់\";}s:4:\"desc\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:141:\"World-class building and civil engineering solutions. We deliver robust structures tailored to residential, commercial, and industrial needs.\";s:2:\"kh\";s:397:\"ដំណោះស្រាយវិស្វកម្មស៊ីវិល និងសំណង់កម្រិតពិភពលោក។ យើងផ្តល់ជូននូវរចនាសម្ព័ន្ធរឹងមាំតម្រូវតាមតម្រូវការលំនៅដ្ឋាន ពាណិជ្ជកម្ម និងឧស្សាហកម្ម។\";}s:5:\"image\";s:38:\"/images/webp/projects/Thumbnail-1.webp\";s:8:\"features\";a:4:{i:0;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Civil Engineering\";}i:1;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Building Structure\";}i:2;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"MEP Systems\";}i:3;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Industrial Plants\";}}}i:2;a:5:{s:2:\"id\";s:18:\"project-management\";s:5:\"title\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:18:\"Project Management\";s:2:\"kh\";s:54:\"ការគ្រប់គ្រងគម្រោង\";}s:4:\"desc\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:163:\"Comprehensive oversight and strategic advisory ensuring on-time, on-budget delivery. We combine rigorous on-field management with technical and financial insights.\";s:2:\"kh\";s:526:\"ការត្រួតពិនិត្យដ៏ទូលំទូលាយ និងការផ្តល់ប្រឹក្សាយុទ្ធសាស្រ្តធានាបាននូវការដឹកជញ្ជូនទាន់ពេល និងចំថវិកា។ យើងរួមបញ្ចូលការគ្រប់គ្រងយ៉ាងតឹងរ៉ឹងជាមួយចំណេះដឹងផ្នែកបច្ចេកទេស និងហិរញ្ញវត្ថុ។\";}s:5:\"image\";s:38:\"/images/webp/projects/Thumbnail-1.webp\";s:8:\"features\";a:4:{i:0;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"Cost Control & Value Engineering\";}i:1;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Feasibility Studies\";}i:2;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Quality & Safety Compliance\";}i:3;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Regulatory Advice\";}}}i:3;a:5:{s:2:\"id\";s:14:\"infrastructure\";s:5:\"title\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:14:\"Infrastructure\";s:2:\"kh\";s:54:\"ហេដ្ឋារចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ\";}s:4:\"desc\";a:2:{s:2:\"en\";s:123:\"Developing critical infrastructure including roads, bridges, and public utilities. We build foundation for national growth.\";s:2:\"kh\";s:349:\"ការអភិវឌ្ឍហេដ្ឋារចនាសម្ព័ន្ធសំខាន់ៗរួមមាន ផ្លូវ ស្ពាន និងឧបករណ៍ប្រើប្រាស់សាធារណៈ។ យើងកសាងមូលដ្ឋានគ្រឹះសម្រាប់កំណើនជាតិ។\";}s:5:\"image\";s:38:\"/images/webp/projects/Thumbnail-1.webp\";s:8:\"features\";a:4:{i:0;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:26:\"Road & Bridge Construction\";}i:1;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Public Utility Networks\";}i:2;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Slope Protection\";}i:3;a:1:{s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Land Reclamation\";}}}}',1780514761),
